WEBVTT

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:33.596
In particular, the notion
is that if you see things or hear things,

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:34.846
you're going mad.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.895
But the psychotic hallucinations
are quite different.

00:10:37.919 --> 00:10:41.118
Psychotic hallucinations,
whether they are visual or vocal,

00:10:41.142 --> 00:10:42.318
they address you.

00:10:42.342 --> 00:10:47.052
They accuse you, they seduce you,
they humiliate you, they jeer at you.

00:10:48.072 --> 00:10:49.657
You interact with them.

00:10:50.643 --> 00:10:53.614
There is none of this quality
of being addressed

00:10:53.638 --> 00:10:56.099
with these Charles Bonnet hallucinations.

00:10:56.123 --> 00:11:00.726
There is a film. You're seeing a film
which has nothing to do with you --